      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## P-H3 Image2Image\nChoose an image on Load Image before queuing. Picture 1 is the base.\n\nAdd further images or visual RefMods to the writer's growing reference inputs. Drag its strip to reorder, click to disable, and use role to state what to take. RefMods expand to pictures; the writer's summary reports exact Picture numbers. For files without pictures, connect the original H3 video VAE to refmod_vae.\n\nReference Slots picture_1 through picture_8 are already wired to Conditioning in the same order.\n\nRequires ComfyUI 0.44.0 or newer. The upsampler and image text encoder are separate models; both Load CLIP nodes use type minimax.\n\nUse the eight-step sigmas shown here, ER SDE, BasicGuider (no CFG), and shifts 1.0/1.0. Models: https://huggingface.co/PrunaAI/P-H3-Image-Comfy\n\nPrompt library: run once, then save or edit the result. repeat_last reuses text with the current pictures and canvas. bypass passes the request through without rewriting."
      ]
    }
